  "status": "Six documentation literal/link sites corrected; complete language and affected module rendering and displayed-text regression pass on all three distributions. Final RPM qualification remains required.",
  "root_causes": [
    "Unclosed quoted reference labels in historical release notes and TableMapper consume following documentation commands.",
    "A grave accent inside the HTTPClient inline literal is parsed as an open Markdown code span by Fedora Doxygen, also preventing its constructor signature from entering the index. A verbatim character block preserves it independently of Markdown mode.",
    "SMTP and end-of-line examples need Doxygen escapes, not numeric HTML entities that are displayed literally. The URL now uses the correct user:password@host order."
  ],
